			"color":"#232",
			"widgets_values":[
				"Initial Framing:\nThe video begins with a composition similar to the original image: blurred yellow and green foliage (bokeh) in the foreground, and a bright red modern Porsche 911 sports car parked on a flagstone driveway in the mid-ground. To the left is an orange-red wall; to the right, an olive tree and the shimmering blue waters of a lake. The car gleams in the intense sunlight. The shot is already sharply focused on the vehicle.\n\nAction:\nAn extremely slow, smooth, and controlled dolly-in movement begins, advancing toward the red car.\n\nTransition Details:\n\nForeground Receding: As the camera moves forward, the blurred foreground foliage gradually drifts out of the frame or becomes so magnified and blurred that it no longer obstructs the view.\n\nPerspective Deepening: The perspective deepens, making the texture of the flagstone driveway increasingly distinct. The car gradually fills the frame. The wall on the left and the olive tree on the right shift outward toward the edges of the frame.\n\nKey Focus:\nSharp focus is maintained on the red Porsche’s bodywork, wheels, and door handle. As the camera draws closer, the details of the sunlight reflecting off the car's paintwork and wheel rims become incredibly rich and captivating."
			],
